# PM-012: keep every tracked file under 1 MB. Meshes, CAD, raw fields and console logs stay out of git
# (they live under $PM012_CFD_ROOT, a folder outside the repo, or cfd/results/raw; cfd/README.md says how to regenerate them).
*.stl
*.STL
*.step
*.STEP
*.stp
*.vtk
*.bin
*.log
results/raw/
__pycache__/
